WEBVTT

00:52:59.621 --> 00:53:03.079
I want to put into the world, if
it's not only that and that,

00:53:03.371 --> 00:53:06.871
it becomes also something that
is meaningful to others,

00:53:07.204 --> 00:53:12.371
that's a big thing to contribute to the
world. And I think that for me.

00:53:13.329 --> 00:53:17.913
That sense of like rightness or a sense
of like if this mission is fulfilled,

00:53:18.288 --> 00:53:21.246
will it extend beyond my
small little life?

00:53:21.538 --> 00:53:25.204
Like I feel that I feel that
as a sort of powerful call.

00:53:25.871 --> 00:53:28.288
Cheryl, I have to ask questions
for you. OK.

00:53:28.954 --> 00:53:34.871
The first is something that I was
really heartened to read about.